  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coalitions for Change Program Phase 2 - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coalitions for Change Program Phase 2 (CfC2), delivered by The Asia Foundation, builds on the success of Phase 1 (2011 to 2018) and continues to work with formal and informal networks and coalitions who are advocating for transformative policy reforms that improve the lives of Filipinos. The program engages with civil society, the private sector, the academic community, and the Government to pursue technically sound and politically feasible reforms. CfC2 has a new component which aims to identify and develop local leaders and champions who are seeking to bring about transformative change consistent with the Philippines&apos; development priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
